XONLINE_E_OUT_OF_MEMORY=THERE WAS NOT ENOUGH MEMORY TO CREATE THE ASYNCHRONOUS LOGON TASK.
XONLINE_E_TASK_BUSY=ANOTHER LOGON TASK IS CURRENTLY BEING PERFORMED, OR THE PREVIOUS LOGON TASK HAS NOT BEEN CLOSED.
