XONLINE_E_MATCH_INVALID_TITLE_ID=INVALID TITLE ID.
XONLINE_E_MATCH_INVALID_DATA_TYPE=ATTRIBUTE ID OR PARAMETER TYPE SPECIFIES AN INVALID DATA TYPE.
XONLINE_E_MATCH_REQUEST_TOO_SMALL=THE REQUEST DID NOT MEET THE MINIMUM LENGTH FOR A VALID REQUEST.
