XONLINE_E_MATCH_INVALID_VERSION=BAD PROTOCOL VERSION IN REQUEST.
XONLINE_E_MATCH_OVERFLOW=AN ATTRIBUTE OR PARAMETER FLOWED PAST THE END OF THE REQUEST.
XONLINE_E_MATCH_INVALID_RESULT_COL=REFERENCED STORED PROCEDURE RETURNED A COLUMN WITH AN UNSUPPORTED DATA TYPE.
XONLINE_E_MATCH_INVALID_STRING=STRING WITH LENGTH-PREFIX OF ZERO, OR STRING WITH NO TERMINATING NULL.
XONLINE_E_MATCH_STRING_TOO_LONG=STRING EXCEEDED 400 CHARACTERS.
