XONLINE_E_BILLING_NON_ACTIVE_ACCOUNT=THE ACCOUNT SPECIFIED IS NO LONGER ACTIVE; USER SHOULD CALL CUSTOMER SERVICE.
XONLINE_E_BILLING_INVALID_PAYMENT_INSTRUMENT_STATUS=USER'S PAYMENT INSTRUMENT IS IN A BAD STATE. THEY SHOULD CALL CUSTOMER SERVICE TO RECTIFY THE ISSUE.
